- candidate_created: origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha, shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta: true.
- candidate_vehicle_linked:
   - origin_availability_alpha - vehicle_unit_alpha
   - destination_availability_alpha - vehicle_unit_beta
   - shift_candidate_alpha - vehicle_unit_gamma
- vehicle_allocated: same as above (since allocated when vehicle linked? Actually init shows vehicle_allocated for each of those three. Yes.
- vehicle_available: none initially (since all allocated). So vehicle_unit_alpha, beta, gamma not available.
- dispatch_allocated: shift_candidate_alpha true. Others false.
- candidate_dispatch_slot_linked: shift_candidate_alpha - dispatch_slot_alpha true.
- dispatch_slot_available: false (since allocated).
- candidate_prepared: shift_candidate_alpha true. Others false.
- candidate_task_profile_linked: none initially.
- route_task_profile_available: true.
- cargo_available: cargo_payload_alpha true.
- origin_availability_node_linked: origin_availability_alpha - origin_node_alpha true.
- destination_availability_node_linked: destination_availability_alpha - destination_node_alpha true.
- origin_node_ready: false.
- origin_node_occupied: false.
- destination_node_ready: false.
- destination_node_occupied: false.
- origin_availability_confirmed: false.
- origin_availability_locked: false.
- destination_availability_confirmed: false.
- destination_availability_locked: false.
- transport_leg_available: true.
- transport_leg_assembled: false.
- transport_leg_origin_linked: false.
- transport_leg_destination_linked: false.
- origin_leg_loaded: false.
- destination_leg_loaded: false.
- transport_leg_loading_authorized: false.
- compliance_certificate_available: false (since linked to shift_candidate_alpha).
- candidate_compliance_certificate_linked: shift_candidate_alpha - compliance_certificate_alpha true.
- compliance_validation_complete: shift_candidate_alpha true.
- constraint_applied: shift_candidate_alpha true.
- operator_alignment_confirmed: shift_candidate_alpha true.
- operator_available: driver_operator_alpha true.
- candidate_operator_linked: none initially? Actually init does not show any candidate_operator_linked for any candidate. So false.
- loading_container_available: loading_container_alpha true, loading_container_beta true.
- candidate_loading_container_linked: shift_candidate_alpha - loading_container_alpha true; shift_candidate_beta - loading_container_beta true.
- loading_container_loaded: none.
- loading_container_leg_linked: none.
- equipment_available: equipment_resource_alpha true, equipment_resource_beta true.
- candidate_equipment_linked: none.
- equipment_reserved: none.
- equipment_confirmed: none.
- service_window_available: service_window_alpha true, service_window_beta true.
- candidate_service_window_linked: none.
- skill_certificate_available: skill_certificate_alpha true.
- candidate_skill_certificate_linked: none.
- dispatch_slot_available: false (as above).
- candidate_finalized: shift_candidate_alpha true.
- dispatch_ready: shift_candidate_alpha true (init). Others false.
- candidate_staged_for_loading: none.
- candidate_loading_verified: none.
- candidate_clearance_established: none.
- route_sequence_context_set: none.
- route_sequence_validated: none.
- operational_constraint_available: none? Since both constraints linked to shift candidates, so not available.
- candidate_operational_constraint_linked: shift_candidate_alpha - operational_constraint_alpha true; shift_candidate_beta - operational_constraint_beta true.
- constraint_applied: shift_candidate_alpha true (so operational_constraint_alpha not available).
- etc.

Now we step through.

Step1: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha
Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (true). Effect: compliance_certificate_available true; candidate_compliance_certificate_linked false.

Now compliance_certificate_available true.

Step2: execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha
Preconditions:
- dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true (yes)
- candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma true (yes)
- candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha true (yes)
- not dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true (yes)
Effect:
- dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true
- vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true
- dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha true

Now state updates:
- dispatched shift_candidate_alpha = true
- vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma = true
- dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha = true
- (dispatch_allocated remains true)
- (candidate_vehicle_linked unchanged)
- (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked unchanged)

Step3: attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_created origin_availability_alpha true
- vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha true
- route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha true (still true because we haven't used it yet)
Effect:
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true
- route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha false

Now state:
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha - route_task_profile_alpha true
- route_task_profile_available false

Step4: confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_created origin_availability_alpha true
- vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha true
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true
- not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (currently false)
Effect:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true

Now origin_availability_alpha prepared true.

Step5: assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true (yes)
- operator_available driver_operator_alpha true (yes)
Effect:
- candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha true
- operator_available driver_operator_alpha false

Now operator linked to origin, not available.

Step6: activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true (yes)
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true (yes)
- origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha true (yes)
- not origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (currently false) => true
- not origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (currently false) => true
Effect:
- origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true

Step7: load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true (yes)
- origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha true (yes)
- cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha true (yes)
- not origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (currently false) => true
Effect:
- origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha true
- origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha true
- origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha true
- cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha false

Now origin locked, payload linked, cargo not available.

Step8: unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true (yes)
- candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true (yes)
- origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha true (yes)
- origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha true (yes)
- origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha true (yes)
- not origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (currently false) => true
Effect:
- origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true (already true, remains)
- origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha true
- cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha true
- not origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha true (so becomes false)

Note: origin_availability_locked remains true (unchanged). So after step8 we have:
- origin_node_occupied true
- origin_node_ready true
- origin_availability_locked true
- origin_availability_confirmed true
- cargo_available true
- origin_payload_linked false

Good.

Step9: lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Preconditions:
- candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha true (yes)
- candidate_operator_linked origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha true (yes, we assigned earlier and haven't released)
- origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha true (yes)
- origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha true (yes)
